# k3s platform

- Install order in `platform-stack.sh`: Cilium → cert-manager → MetalLB → KubeVirt/CDI → metrics-server.
- Recycle stale pods after CNI/cert-manager/KubeVirt changes when API connectivity was broken.
- Smoke tests live in `platform-test.sh`; JSON via `platform_test::emit_json`.
- Unit tests: `make test-platform-config`, `make test-platform-json`.
- Verify E2E: `./hypercluster -c cluster.conf test --json 2>/dev/null`.
